        "text_fBUF3g": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p><strong>1. Warranty Registration</strong></p><ul><li>Customers must fill out the Warranty Registration Form within 7 days of receiving their product to activate the warranty.</li><li>The warranty will only be considered valid upon successful registration within this time frame.</li><li>The form can be accessed via the QR code or link provided with your purchase.</li></ul><p><strong>2. Warranty Coverage</strong></p><ul><li>Manufacturing defects in material or workmanship.</li><li>Defects in the finish or plating arising during manufacture.</li><li>Clasp or fastening malfunctions not caused by mishandling.</li></ul><p><strong>Note</strong>: Warranty does not cover:</p><ul><li>General wear and tear.</li><li>Damage due to accidents, misuse, exposure to chemicals, perfumes, or water.</li><li>Damage to the finish caused by improper handling or storage.</li><li>Unauthorized repairs or alterations.</li></ul><p><strong>3. Warranty Claim Process</strong></p><ul><li>Fill in the registration form above, following the instructions. Please remember to attach clear photos or videos showing the issue in the appropriate section of the form.</li><li>Once approved, products will be repaired or replaced at Mastt’s discretion.</li><li>Handling charges of Rs. 250/- apply for any polishing or repair on eligible products.</li></ul><p><strong>4. Additional Terms</strong></p><ul><li>Warranty is non-transferable and valid only for the original purchaser.</li><li>Warranty claims are processed within 7–14 working days after inspection.</li><li>Shipping charges for sending the product to our service centre are borne by the customer; return shipping is covered by us.</li></ul><p>💎 <strong>The Mastt Promise</strong>: Every piece is checked by hand before it leaves us. Register yours today and wear it with complete peace of mind — that’s what it means to feel Mastt.</p><p>Questions? Email us at <strong>info@mastt.co</strong>.</p>"
